[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "surface-mystery-plot",
      "catalogId": "https://genui.local/specification/v0_9/standard_catalog.json",
      "theme": {
        "primaryColor": "#1a237e",
        "agentDisplayName": "Mystery Writer"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "surface-mystery-plot",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "header",
            "context_section",
            "mystery_section",
            "plot_section",
            "twist_section",
            "actions_section",
            "sources_section"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h2",
          "text": "Luxury Train Murder Mystery Plot Outline: Paris to Istanbul, 1935"
        },
        {
          "id": "context_section",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "context_title",
            "context_body"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "context_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Historical Context"
        },
        {
          "id": "context_body",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "The Simplon Orient Express in 1935 operated daily from Paris (Gare de Lyon) via Lausanne, Milan, Venice, Trieste, Zagreb, and Belgrade to Istanbul, featuring Art Deco luxury cars with sleeping compartments, dining saloons by René Lalique, and passengers including diplomats, aristocrats, and artists amid pre-WWII tensions."
        },
        {
          "id": "mystery_section",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "mystery_title",
            "victim_text",
            "weapon_text",
            "suspects_title",
            "suspects_list"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mystery_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Core Mystery Elements"
        },
        {
          "id": "victim_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "**Victim:** Sir Reginald Hargrove, a wealthy British industrialist and arms dealer in his 60s, found stabbed to death in his locked sleeping compartment at dawn on the second night."
        },
        {
          "id": "weapon_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "**Murder Weapon:** A rare Art Deco letter opener with a jade handle, engraved with Hargrove's initials, sourced from his own luggage—missing until discovered embedded in his chest."
        },
        {
          "id": "suspects_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Suspects"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspects_list",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "suspect_1_card",
            "suspect_2_card",
            "suspect_3_card"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_1_card",
          "component": "Card",
          "child": "suspect_1_content"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_1_content",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "suspect_1_name",
            "suspect_1_motive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_1_name",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h5",
          "text": "Elena Voss (30s)"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_1_motive",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Hargrove's glamorous Austrian mistress. Motive: Blackmail over a love child; she argued publicly with him about inheritance before retiring."
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_2_card",
          "component": "Card",
          "child": "suspect_2_content"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_2_content",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "suspect_2_name",
            "suspect_2_motive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_2_name",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h5",
          "text": "Count Viktor Dragomir (40s)"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_2_motive",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Romanian diplomat. Motive: Hargrove's arms deals undermined Dragomir's anti-fascist network; seen slipping away from the dining car suspiciously."
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_3_card",
          "component": "Card",
          "child": "suspect_3_content"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_3_content",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "suspect_3_name",
            "suspect_3_motive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_3_name",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h5",
          "text": "Madame Isabelle Laurent (50s)"
        },
        {
          "id": "suspect_3_motive",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "French heiress and jeweler. Motive: Hargrove ruined her family business via a hostile takeover; she carried a grudge voiced over dinner."
        },
        {
          "id": "plot_section",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "plot_title",
            "act1_col",
            "act2_col",
            "act3_col"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "plot_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Plot Outline"
        },
        {
          "id": "act1_col",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "act1_header",
            "act1_text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "act1_header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Act 1: Departure and Setup (Paris to Milan)"
        },
        {
          "id": "act1_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "The train departs Paris amid glamour. Hargrove boasts of deals; suspects interact tensely. A snowstorm looms, echoing 1929 drifts that stranded trains."
        },
        {
          "id": "act2_col",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "act2_header",
            "act2_text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "act2_header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Act 2: Murder and Investigation (Venice to Belgrade)"
        },
        {
          "id": "act2_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Body discovered post-midnight. Inspector Emile Roux, a sharp Belgian detective aboard, interviews suspects under claustrophobic conditions. Alibis crack: Elena's jewels missing, Dragomir's papers forged, Laurent's hidden dagger."
        },
        {
          "id": "act3_col",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "act3_header",
            "act3_text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "act3_header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Act 3: Climax and Red Herrings (Belgrade to Istanbul)"
        },
        {
          "id": "act3_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Suspects accuse each other; a forged suicide note surfaces. Roux uncovers Hargrove's ledger of betrayals. Train snowed in near Sofia, heightening paranoia."
        },
        {
          "id": "twist_section",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "twist_title",
            "twist_text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "twist_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Final Plot Twist"
        },
        {
          "id": "twist_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Roux reveals the killer as the victim's twin brother, disguised as a steward. The brother, presumed dead in WWI, sought revenge for Hargrove stealing his identity and fortune. The letter opener was planted; true weapon: poison in Hargrove's evening cognac."
        },
        {
          "id": "actions_section",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "actions_title",
            "actions_row"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "actions_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Quick Actions"
        },
        {
          "id": "actions_row",
          "component": "Row",
          "children": [
            "action_btn_1",
            "action_btn_2",
            "action_btn_3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "action_btn_1",
          "component": "Button",
          "child": "action_txt_1",
          "action": {
            "event": {
              "name": "expandNovel"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "action_txt_1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Expand into Novel"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_btn_2",
          "component": "Button",
          "child": "action_txt_2",
          "action": {
            "event": {
              "name": "visualizeRoute"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "action_txt_2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Visualize Route"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_btn_3",
          "component": "Button",
          "child": "action_txt_3",
          "action": {
            "event": {
              "name": "customize"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "action_txt_3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Customize"
        },
